      "content": "it just feels like there's no way to fix it. everyone saw me as this perfect person, this success story. now im just a failure. if i show up home like this, i'll just be a constant reminder of what i lost. i feel like i've already lost my place in the family. i'd rather they just remember me the way i used to be instead of seeing me like this.",
