      "content": "i know you're trying to help but it's just not that simple. words don't change the fact that i'm a disappointment now. i've spent my whole life building this image and now it's just broken. it's like the only way to protect the memory of who i was is to just... stop. stop everyone from seeing the mess i've become. if i stay, all they'll ever see is the failure.",
